# TOY mesh from test_adenc_hydroflow.f90; these node numbers are NOT Rhine ports.
# Copy and replace port edges with verified FE ARRAY node indices, not arbitrary Gmsh tags.
# Enable reconstruction (requires conservative and no-flow-bank modes).
y
# Lateral policy: 0 = none; 1 = explicit lateral.conf (see lateral.conf.example).
# Resolved tributaries enter through distinct listed inlet boundary IDs.
0
# Time interpolation: 1 = linear daily Q and endpoint-derived H; 0 = daily jumps.
1
# Relative local water-balance tolerance; maximum PCG iterations.
1e-10
20000
# Maximum relative L2 edge-flux correction. 1 means 100%, not a calibration criterion.
1.0
# Number of explicit port edges.
4
# node1 node2 kind discharge[m3/s]
# kind -1=inlet, +1=outlet. Inlet 0 uses Qrouted; outlet 0 is free balanced discharge.
# Both inlet edges have the SAME concentration boundary ID; Q is split, NOT repeated.
1 3 -1 0
3 5 -1 0
2 4  1 0
4 6  1 0
# Optional: remove whole disconnected components with no explicit ports.
# Default absent/n keeps strict inlet/outlet checks. Never removes explicit sources.
n
